---
import LightLayout from "../layouts/LightLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";
---

<LightLayout title="About" section="About">
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <p class="page-subtitle">The short version.</p>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>
      I'm <strong>{site.name}</strong>, a research scientist and engineer
      working across neuroscience, AI, and research infrastructure. At MIT
      SQI, I build
      <a href="https://www.brain-score.org" target="_blank" rel="noopener">software</a>
      for evaluating how closely artificial systems match biological
      intelligence. I previously completed a PhD in Neuroscience, where I
      modeled the development of stem-cell-derived neuronal networks.
    </p>

    <p>
      My work sits between scientific questions and the tools needed to
      answer them: model evaluation, neural data analysis, simulation, and
      systems that make research easier to run and extend.
    </p>

    <p>
      Reach me at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> or on
      <a href={site.social.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</LightLayout>
